# Inferred array keeps each element subtype

Verifies an untyped array literal whose elements share the `int` base but use
different measure subtypes infers an unconstrained `int[]` array while each
element keeps its own subtype.

>>> source
let sizes = [10mm, 2cm, 3dm]
print(sizes[0])
print(sizes[1])
print(sizes[2])

<<< stdout
10mm
2cm
3dm

<<< stderr
